## What is and is not covered

Covered: the derived numeric panel and its companion files, the curated deposit
rate series, and the enumerated filing reference lists. These are figures
extracted from mandatory public regulatory disclosures, together with the
provenance needed to trace each one.

Not covered, and not distributed here: the source filings themselves. The
managers' own PDF and XLSX documents are not redistributed from this repository.
`data/raw` is excluded from version control. Anyone who wants the primary
documents should fetch them from the managers, which `python -m vnflows.run
fetch` does at one request per second with an identifying user agent.

## Attribution and upstream terms

The underlying disclosures are filed under Appendix XXIV of Circular
98/2020/TT-BTC and published by Vietcombank Fund Management, VinaCapital Fund
Management, SSI Asset Management and Dragon Capital Vietfund Management. Cite
this dataset for the compilation; cite the managers for the underlying filings.

Machine-readable source terms were checked on 2026-08-16 and are summarised in
METHOD.md section 9. One source, www.vcbf.com, publishes a content signal of
`ai-train=no, use=reference`. Users of this dataset should read that section
before redistributing or ingesting it for purposes beyond reference.

